<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank deputy to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank deputy to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Thailand (BOT) Deputy Governor Chaiyawat Wibulswasdi was due to hold a news conference at 0400 GMT on Monday, BOT officials said.</p>
<p>Officials would not say what would be discussed at the news conference.</p>
<p>Currency dealers said the central bank intervened in the market on Monday and sold dollars at the 30.75-30.80 per dollar level to try to prevent the baht from weakening further.</p>
<p>A Bank of Thailand spokeswoman declined to say whether the central bank had intervened in the market.</p>
</text>
